          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.5.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eph 5.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " What then, brethren? When you come together, each one has a hymn, a lesson, a revelation, a tongue, or an interpretation. Let all things be done for edification. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If any speak in a tongue, let there be only two or at most three, and each in turn; and let one interpret. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if there is no one to interpret, let each of them keep silence in church and speak to himself and to God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let two or three prophets speak, and let the others weigh what is said. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a revelation is made to another sitting by, let the first be silent. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For you can all prophesy one by one, so that all may learn and all be encouraged; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the spirits of prophets are subject to prophets. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For God is not a God of confusion but of peace.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As in all the churches of the saints, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TI.2.11+1TI.2.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tim 2.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the women should keep silence in the churches. For they are not permitted to speak, but should be subordinate, as even the law says. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If there is anything they desire to know, let them ask their husbands at home. For it is shameful for a woman to speak in church. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What! Did the word of God originate with you, or are you the only ones it has reached?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If any one thinks that he is a prophet, or spiritual, he should acknowledge that what I am writing to you is a command of the Lord. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If any one does not recognize this, he is not recognized. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So, my brethren, earnestly desire to prophesy, and do not forbid speaking in tongues; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but all things should be done decently and in order.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
